# ============================================================================
# .gitignore  --  Splat_RF_Analysis
# ============================================================================
# Design principle: OPEN TOOL / PRIVATE REGIONAL DATA.
# The reusable tooling (SPLAT! orchestration, PostGIS schema, foliage models,
# tile fetchers) is public-friendly. The user's specific site coordinates,
# operating locations, callsign, and DB credentials are PRIVATE and must never
# be committed. Structure enforces this: real config lives in *.local.* files
# and a gitignored data/ tree; only *.example templates are tracked.
# ============================================================================

# --- PRIVATE regional / operational config (NEVER COMMIT) -------------------
# Real site coordinates, relay spots, callsign, ERP, DB credentials live here.
# Only the *.example templates are tracked (see !exceptions below).
config/*.local.yml
config/*.local.yaml
config/*.local.ini
config/secrets*
.env

# --- Terrain data (large, reproducible from public SRTM sources) ------------
# SRTM .hgt tiles and derived SPLAT! .sdf files are large and re-fetchable.
# Do not bloat the repo; the fetcher script reproduces them.
data/srtm/*
data/sdf/*
!data/srtm/.gitkeep
!data/sdf/.gitkeep
*.hgt
*.hgt.zip
*.sdf
*.sdf.gz

# --- Generated analysis outputs (reproducible) ------------------------------
# Path profiles, coverage maps, KML overlays -- regenerate on demand.
outputs/*
!outputs/.gitkeep
*.ppm
*.png
*.kml
*.kmz
# SPLAT! scratch/report artifacts
*.qth
*.lrp
*.scf
*-site_report.txt

# --- Report deliverables ARE tracked (re-include after the broad ignores) ---
# Figures + KML overlays + study CSV under reports/ and studies/ are committed
# so the repo carries the analysis, per "meat lives in the repo".
!reports/figures/**/*.png
!reports/figures/**/*.kml
!reports/**/*.pdf
!studies/**/*.csv

# --- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
build/
dist/

# Session summary — local working notes, never committed
*_summary.md
*_summary.claude

# --- OS / editor cruft ------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# ============================================================================
# EXCEPTIONS -- templates that MUST be tracked (order matters; after ignores)
# ============================================================================
!config/sites.example.yml
!config/antennas.example.yml
!config/bands.example.yml
!config/database.example.yml
